    "answer": {
      "short": "$80$",
      "worked": "Multiples of $8$ are $8,16,24,32,40,\\ldots$. The first divisible by $5$ is $40$.\n\n$\\operatorname{LCM}(8,5)=40$\n\nMultiples of $40$ are $40,80,120,\\ldots$. The only one between $70$ and $90$ is $80$.",
